{
  "info": {
    "name": "Central Archive - 04 Import & Migration",
    "_postman_id": "import-migration-collection-0004",
    "description": "Branch Package import and legacy DB Migration endpoints.\n\nBase URL: {{baseUrl}} (default http://localhost:8080)\n\n## First step\nRun **Setup > Login** once. It stores the token into `{{token}}` automatically. Bearer auth is configured at collection level.\n\n## Branch packages\nA TERMINAL produces a package manifest (JSON), which the central system receives via multipart (`receive`) or raw JSON (`receive/json`). Then verify, then import (with organization mapping / duplicate handling).\n\n## Import operations\nEach import creates operations per module that can be polled/updated by status: STARTED, SUCCESS, FAILED, PARTIAL.\n\n## Migration\nDefine a source (legacy DB), create batches, run a batch with connection config, then complete it.\n\n## Auto-captured IDs\nAfter receiving a package / creating an operation / creating a source or batch, ids are stored into `{{packageId}}`, `{{operationId}}`, `{{migrationSourceId}}`, `{{batchId}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://w0x89x36-8080.euw.devtunnels.ms", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "admin", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "admin123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orgId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "packageId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "operationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "migrationSourceId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "batchId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (required)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = json && json.data ? json.data : json;",
                  "if (data && data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.token);",
                  "if (data && data.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
